{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nw5SlxFg3j1795533824.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>上日報復急升的美股三大指數，周二全線低開後個別發展。</p><p></p><p>道指曾跌300點，跌穿49,300點後調頭回升。市值重返第二大的輝達，上日大升三成後，今日早段回吐約半成，曾經跌穿154美元。晶片商美光科技和閃迪，早段急挫約百分之9。納斯達克指數一開市失守24,000點關口，曾跌逾400點，跌幅近百分之2。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:44:26.171236+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:57:18.130442+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T16:37:40.793685+00:00","content_hash":"4d6641e82943011edf65c2d3c136a5e42ea94463a5493c57aae8b0bd33f11d6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}